    "summary": "I built a four-cell planter: a straight row of four bolted bases, each with a drainage planter bin, and one irrigation pipe running through all four bases. The last check found no rule errors and no mesh clashes. The pipe reaches every cell, but the build has no part that lets water out into each bin, so I've marked \"feeds every cell\" as partial. The cells are in a straight line so the pipe could run straight, and with a pipe through a base only shallow third-depth bins fit."
